{'symbol': 'NEE', 'date': '2022-02-18 07:30:00', 'title': 'NEXTERA ENERGY BOARD DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND AND CONTINUES ABOVE-AVERAGE TARGETED GROWTH RATE IN DIVIDENDS PER SHARE THROUGH AT LEAST 2024', 'text': 'JUNO BEACH, FLA., FEB. 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF NEXTERA ENERGY, INC. (NYSE: NEE) DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND OF $0.425, AN APPROXIMATE 10% INCREASE VERSUS THE PRIOR-YEAR COMPARABLE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND.'}